---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="You found it." description="For the curious.">
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center">
    <img
      src="/images/colophon.svg"
      alt="O & R"
      class="w-20 mb-12 dark:invert"
      style="opacity: 0.6;"
      width="80"
      height="80"
    />

    <h1 class="type-display mb-8" style="font-size: var(--text-2xl);">
      You found it.
    </h1>

    <div class="prose-wedding mx-auto text-center space-y-6 max-w-sm">
      <p style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-ink) 70%, transparent);">
        There's no prize for this, but there should be.
      </p>
      <p style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-ink) 70%, transparent);">
        You typed `/secret` into the address bar, or you followed some trail of breadcrumbs
        that led here. Either way, you're exactly the kind of person we wanted at this wedding.
      </p>
      <p style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-ink) 70%, transparent);">
        The dog's name is Esme. She is not the password — but that's how you would have guessed it anyway.
      </p>
      <p style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-ink) 70%, transparent);">
        See you July 11.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a
      href="/"
      class="type-label mt-16 link-draw"
      style="color: var(--c-terracotta);"
    >
      ← Back
    </a>
  </div>
</Base>
